<title>UK: Sachsen-Anhalt sets 500 mln mark five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Sachsen-Anhalt sets 500 mln mark five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers ABN AMRO Hoare Govett, BGB, BZW, CDC and NordLB.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LAND SACHSEN ANHALT</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.25	MATURITY    27.MAR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  97.385    PAY DATE    27.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.25	LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 10	  MGT/UND    0.06	SELL CONC   0.19</p>
<p> NOTES	NOTES WILL BE REDENOMINATED IN EUROS AFTER THIRD</p>
<p>		STAGE OF EMU</p>
<p>		LANDESCHATZANWEISUNG SERIES 43</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
